{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-52284-r4518200","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Broccoli Burgers","sourcePageId":52284,"sourceRevision":"4518200","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-21T16:18:00Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Broccoli%20Burgers&oldid=4518200","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:24:46.577Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Baked recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for hamburgers","Category:Recipes using almond","Category:Recipes using bread crumb","Category:Recipes using broccoli","Category:Recipes using egg","Category:Recipes using lettuce","Category:Recipes with metric units","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings","Category:Vegetarian recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"f8e65c78bd633d04840aa22d20a37503b6d3555461fe133aab459931226e4138","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Vegetarian recipes\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n\n'''Broccoli burgers''' are a handheld foodstuff similar to hamburgers though produced with eggs and vegetables in place of beef.\n\n== Ingredients ==\n* 2 standard [[cookbook:egg|egg]]s\n* 240 [[Cookbook:Milliliter|ml]] (1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]]) [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] [[cookbook:broccoli|broccoli]]\n* 120 ml (&frac12; cup) chopped toasted [[cookbook:almond|almond]]s\n* 190 ml (&frac34; cup) chopped [[cookbook:Red onion|red onion]]\n* 120 ml (&frac12; cup) seasoned dry [[cookbook:Bread Crumb|bread crumbs]]\n* 80 ml (&frac14; cup) [[cookbook:water|water]]\n* [[cookbook:Salt|Salt]] to taste\n* [[cookbook:pepper|Pepper]], to taste\n* Toasted buns or [[cookbook:bread|bread]]\n* [[cookbook:Mayonnaise|Mayonnaise]]\n* [[cookbook:Lettuce|Lettuce]]\n\n== Preparation ==\n# In a bowl, [[cookbook:beat|beat]] eggs. \n# Stir in broccoli, almonds, onion, breadcrumbs and water. \n# Add salt and pepper to taste. \n# On an oiled 30x38 cm (12x15-inch) [[cookbook:Baking Sheet|baking sheet]], shape mixture into 4 patties, each 2 cm (¾ inch) thick.\n# [[cookbook:Bake|Bake]] in 190 °C (375 °F) [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]], turning halfway through cooking, until each side is golden brown, about 25 minutes total. \n# Serve on buns with mayonnaise and lettuce.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using almond]]\n[[Category:Recipes using broccoli]]\n[[Category:Vegetarian recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for hamburgers]]\n[[Category:Baked recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bread crumb]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lettuce]]","isRecipe":false,"recipe":{"name":"Broccoli Burgers","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2 standard eggs","sourceText":"2 standard eggs","amountText":"2 standard eggs","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"240 ml (1 cup) chopped broccoli","sourceText":"240 ml (1 cup) chopped broccoli","amountText":"240 ml (1 cup) chopped broccoli","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"120 ml (&frac12; cup) chopped toasted almonds","sourceText":"120 ml (&frac12; cup) chopped toasted almonds","amountText":"120 ml (&frac12; cup) chopp